& [Purpose]
  + form SWA-02 as a pure provider-free compiler from one exact SWA-01 proposal and objective to one bounded causally ordered work-plan proposal
  + make requested capability visible while keeping every capability ungranted pending its separately signed broker

& [Profiles]
  + [OWP-001] request profile is cantor-objective-work-plan-request/0.1 and proposal profile is cantor-objective-work-plan-proposal/0.1
  + [OWP-002] all forms deny unknown fields and use deterministic JSON only

& [BootAndObjective]
  + [OWP-003] request retains the complete validated SWA-01 proposal and its proposed session identity
  + [OWP-004] objective identity and digest equal the boot proposal objective exactly
  + [OWP-005] plan identity revision digest authority identity digest and one through 32 evidence references are mandatory

& [Plan]
  + [OWP-006] plan has one through 64 steps with unique identities contiguous one-based ordinals bounded labels and exact lower-ordinal dependencies
  + [OWP-007] first step has no dependencies and every later step has at least one dependency
  + [OWP-008] step classes are inspect analyze propose_update verify propose_publication and propose_succeeding_sop
  + [OWP-009] requested capabilities are workspace_read workspace_mutation test_execution commit push provider_call external_effect and sop_activation
  + [OWP-010] analyze requests no capability and each other class requests only its exact P0 capability set
  + [OWP-011] requested capability union is rederived from every step

& [AuthorityAccount]
  + [OWP-012] account contains all eight capabilities exactly once as not_granted_pending_contract
  + [OWP-013] proposal lifecycle is admitted_plan_not_executing and authority is planning_only
  + [OWP-014] exact denials retain every capability and nonauthority forbids execution update publication provider effect or activation claims
  + [OWP-015] unresolved account is exactly workspace_not_admitted capabilities_not_granted work_not_started updates_not_applied and succeeding_sop_not_authored

& [DigestsAndFaults]
  + [OWP-016] request and proposal digests are domain-separated SHA256 and complete request correspondence is rederived
  + [OWP-017] profile identity digest boot objective plan step dependency capability evidence unresolved lifecycle authority correspondence and machine faults are typed
  + [OWP-018] any request step account output denial lifecycle authority or digest mutation refuses atomically

& [Acceptance]
  + [OWP-A01] source predecessor canonical explosion review signature plan matrix and lock bind exactly
  + [OWP-A02] valid multi-step plan compiles validates serializes and byte-identically replays
  + [OWP-A03] boot objective identity ordinal dependency class capability account bound evidence unresolved denial output and unknown-field substitutions refuse
  + [OWP-A04] focused debug release lint format workspace evidence attribution publication and replay gates pass

& [Delineation]
  + objective identity plan structure requested capabilities and not-granted account are inside
  + objective selection judgment session opening workspace admission read mutation test execution commit push provider effects SOP authorship activation and physical work are outside

